/fig><fig id="f4-ebo-4-097" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Prediction results on Pfam data, <bold>1</bold>) mean accuracy rate, <bold>2</bold>) fraction of statistically significant predictions, <bold>3</bold>) number of predictions above the threshold.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ebo-04-097-g04"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>